[{"id":"asa-2-4-14-1","words":["verb:asa-2"],"options":[{"bs":"ne sluša","en":"he/it disobeys"},{"bs":"nisu me poslušali","en":"they disobeyed me"},{"bs":"i nisu poslušali","en":"and they disobeyed"},{"bs":"nije me poslušao","en":"he/it disobeyed me"}],"ref":"4:14","answerWord":"يَعْصِ","answerSound":"audio/9499f68d3144bda67d2e.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"And whoso disobeyeth Allah and His messenger and transgresseth His limits, He will make him enter Fire, where he will dwell for ever; his will be a shameful doom.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"ne poslušati, biti neposlušan","en":"to disobey"},"passage":["وَمَن","يَعْصِ","ٱللَّهَ","وَرَسُولَهُۥ","وَيَتَعَدَّ","حُدُودَهُۥ","يُدْخِلْهُ","نَارًا","خَٰلِدًا","فِيهَا","وَلَهُۥ","عَذَابٌ","مُّهِينٌ"],"marked":[1],"facts":{"verb":"عَصَى"}},{"id":"asa-2-6-15-4","words":["verb:asa-2"],"options":[{"bs":"nisam poslušao","en":"I disobeyed"},{"bs":"ne slušaju te","en":"they disobey you"},{"bs":"nisu me poslušali","en":"they disobeyed me"},{"bs":"i nismo poslušali","en":"and we disobeyed"}],"ref":"6:15","answerWord":"عَصَيْتُ","answerSound":"audio/a0571f4c8fb88959169c.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Say: I fear, if I rebel against my Lord, the retribution of an Awful Day.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"ne poslušati, biti neposlušan","en":"to disobey"},"passage":["قُلْ","إِنِّىٓ","أَخَافُ","إِنْ","عَصَيْتُ","رَبِّى","عَذَابَ","يَوْمٍ","عَظِيمٍ"],"marked":[4],"facts":{"verb":"عَصَى"}},{"id":"asa-2-2-93-13","words":["verb:asa-2"],"options":[{"bs":"i nismo poslušali","en":"and we disobeyed"},{"bs":"nisu poslušali","en":"they disobeyed"},{"bs":"nije me poslušao","en":"he/it disobeyed me"},{"bs":"ne sluša","en":"he/it disobeys"}],"ref":"2:93","answerWord":"وَعَصَيْنَا","answerSound":"audio/9353fdb2c0cac1ebb61c.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"And when We made with you a covenant and caused the Mount to tower above you, (saying): Hold fast by that which We have given you, and hear (Our Word), they said: We hear and we rebel. And (worship of) the calf was made to sink into their hearts because of their rejection (of the covenant). Say (unto them): Evil is that which your belief enjoineth on you, if ye are believers.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"ne poslušati, biti neposlušan","en":"to disobey"},"passage":["وَإِذْ","أَخَذْنَا","مِيثَٰقَكُمْ","وَرَفَعْنَا","فَوْقَكُمُ","ٱلطُّورَ","خُذُوا۟","مَآ","ءَاتَيْنَٰكُم","بِقُوَّةٍ","وَٱسْمَعُوا۟","قَالُوا۟","سَمِعْنَا","وَعَصَيْنَا","وَأُشْرِبُوا۟","فِى","قُلُوبِهِمُ","ٱلْعِجْلَ","بِكُفْرِهِمْ","قُلْ","بِئْسَمَا","يَأْمُرُكُم","بِهِۦٓ","إِيمَٰنُكُمْ","إِن","كُنتُم","مُّؤْمِنِينَ"],"marked":[13],"facts":{"verb":"عَصَى"}},{"id":"asa-2-4-42-4","words":["verb:asa-2"],"options":[{"bs":"i nisu poslušali","en":"and they disobeyed"},{"bs":"i niste poslušali","en":"and you (all) disobeyed"},{"bs":"ne sluša","en":"he/it disobeys"},{"bs":"nisam ga poslušao","en":"I disobeyed him"}],"ref":"4:42","answerWord":"وَعَصَوُا۟","answerSound":"audio/0968374f369d4d0a915f.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"On that day those who disbelieved and disobeyed the messenger will wish that they were level with the ground, and they can hide no fact from Allah.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"ne poslušati, biti neposlušan","en":"to disobey"},"passage":["يَوْمَئِذٍ","يَوَدُّ","ٱلَّذِينَ","كَفَرُوا۟","وَعَصَوُا۟","ٱلرَّسُولَ","لَوْ","تُسَوَّىٰ","بِهِمُ","ٱلْأَرْضُ","وَلَا","يَكْتُمُونَ","ٱللَّهَ","حَدِيثًا"],"marked":[4],"facts":{"verb":"عَصَى"}},{"id":"asa-2-10-91-2","words":["verb:asa-2"],"options":[{"bs":"nisi poslušao","en":"you disobeyed"},{"bs":"nisam poslušao","en":"I disobeyed"},{"bs":"nisu poslušali","en":"they disobeyed"},{"bs":"oglušim se","en":"I disobey"}],"ref":"10:91","answerWord":"عَصَيْتَ","answerSound":"audio/e6b7b16622fcaecbba47.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"What! Now! When hitherto thou hast rebelled and been of the wrong-doers?","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"ne poslušati, biti neposlušan","en":"to disobey"},"passage":["ءَآلْـَٰٔنَ","وَقَدْ","عَصَيْتَ","قَبْلُ","وَكُنتَ","مِنَ","ٱلْمُفْسِدِينَ"],"marked":[2],"facts":{"verb":"عَصَى"}},{"id":"asa-2-11-59-5","words":["verb:asa-2"],"options":[{"bs":"i nisu poslušali","en":"and they disobeyed"},{"bs":"nije me poslušao","en":"he/it disobeyed me"},{"bs":"pa nije poslušao","en":"so he/it disobeyed"},{"bs":"oglušim se","en":"I disobey"}],"ref":"11:59","answerWord":"وَعَصَوْا۟","answerSound":"audio/08b7025d2f0c2c58f7bb.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"And such were A'ad. They denied the revelations of their Lord and flouted His messengers and followed the command of every froward potentate.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"ne poslušati, biti neposlušan","en":"to disobey"},"passage":["وَتِلْكَ","عَادٌ","جَحَدُوا۟","بِـَٔايَٰتِ","رَبِّهِمْ","وَعَصَوْا۟","رُسُلَهُۥ","وَٱتَّبَعُوٓا۟","أَمْرَ","كُلِّ","جَبَّارٍ","عَنِيدٍ"],"marked":[5],"facts":{"verb":"عَصَى"}},{"id":"asa-2-11-63-17","words":["verb:asa-2"],"options":[{"bs":"nisam ga poslušao","en":"I disobeyed him"},{"bs":"ne slušaju te","en":"they disobey you"},{"bs":"ne slušaju","en":"they disobey"},{"bs":"nije me poslušao","en":"he/it disobeyed me"}],"ref":"11:63","answerWord":"عَصَيْتُهُۥ","answerSound":"audio/2b24525a1961d99ec3e4.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"He said: O my people! Bethink you: if I am (acting) on clear proof from my Lord and there hath come unto me a mercy from Him, who will save me from Allah if I disobey Him? Ye would add to me naught save perdition.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"ne poslušati, biti neposlušan","en":"to disobey"},"passage":["قَالَ","يَٰقَوْمِ","أَرَءَيْتُمْ","إِن","كُنتُ","عَلَىٰ","بَيِّنَةٍ","مِّن","رَّبِّى","وَءَاتَىٰنِى","مِنْهُ","رَحْمَةً","فَمَن","يَنصُرُنِى","مِنَ","ٱللَّهِ","إِنْ","عَصَيْتُهُۥ","فَمَا","تَزِيدُونَنِى","غَيْرَ","تَخْسِيرٍ"],"marked":[17],"facts":{"verb":"عَصَى"}},{"id":"asa-2-14-36-11","words":["verb:asa-2"],"options":[{"bs":"nije me poslušao","en":"he/it disobeyed me"},{"bs":"i nisu poslušali","en":"and they disobeyed"},{"bs":"pa nije poslušao","en":"so he/it disobeyed"},{"bs":"oglušim se","en":"I disobey"}],"ref":"14:36","answerWord":"عَصَانِى","answerSound":"audio/8a7b91556108a10a4b5a.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"My Lord! Lo! they have led many of mankind astray. But whoso followeth me, he verily is of me. And whoso disobeyeth me - Still Thou art Forgiving, Merciful.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"ne poslušati, biti neposlušan","en":"to disobey"},"passage":["رَبِّ","إِنَّهُنَّ","أَضْلَلْنَ","كَثِيرًا","مِّنَ","ٱلنَّاسِ","فَمَن","تَبِعَنِى","فَإِنَّهُۥ","مِنِّى","وَمَنْ","عَصَانِى","فَإِنَّكَ","غَفُورٌ","رَّحِيمٌ"],"marked":[11],"facts":{"verb":"عَصَى"}},{"id":"asa-2-18-69-7","words":["verb:asa-2"],"options":[{"bs":"oglušim se","en":"I disobey"},{"bs":"pa nisu poslušali","en":"so they disobeyed"},{"bs":"nisu te poslušali","en":"they disobeyed you"},{"bs":"nisam poslušao","en":"I disobeyed"}],"ref":"18:69","answerWord":"أَعْصِى","answerSound":"audio/d276aeea6a4827b5a43b.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"He said: Allah willing, thou shalt find me patient and I shall not in aught gainsay thee.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"ne poslušati, biti neposlušan","en":"to disobey"},"passage":["قَالَ","سَتَجِدُنِىٓ","إِن","شَآءَ","ٱللَّهُ","صَابِرًا","وَلَآ","أَعْصِى","لَكَ","أَمْرًا"],"marked":[7],"facts":{"verb":"عَصَى"}},{"id":"asa-2-20-93-2","words":["verb:asa-2"],"options":[{"bs":"zar si onda ne poslušao","en":"so did you disobey"},{"bs":"ne slušaju","en":"they disobey"},{"bs":"oglušim se","en":"I disobey"},{"bs":"nisu te poslušali","en":"they disobeyed you"}],"ref":"20:93","answerWord":"أَفَعَصَيْتَ","answerSound":"audio/bcb869e88711cec6b11b.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"That thou followedst me not? Hast thou then disobeyed my order?","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"ne poslušati, biti neposlušan","en":"to disobey"},"passage":["أَلَّا","تَتَّبِعَنِ","أَفَعَصَيْتَ","أَمْرِى"],"marked":[2],"facts":{"verb":"عَصَى"}},{"id":"asa-2-20-121-11","words":["verb:asa-2"],"options":[{"bs":"i nije poslušao","en":"and he/it disobeyed"},{"bs":"nisu me poslušali","en":"they disobeyed me"},{"bs":"nisu poslušali","en":"they disobeyed"},{"bs":"i niste poslušali","en":"and you (all) disobeyed"}],"ref":"20:121","answerWord":"وَعَصَىٰٓ","answerSound":"audio/0c90ef7933c7de080673.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Then they twain ate thereof, so that their shame became apparent unto them, and they began to hide by heaping on themselves some of the leaves of the Garden. And Adam disobeyed his Lord, so went astray.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"ne poslušati, biti neposlušan","en":"to disobey"},"passage":["فَأَكَلَا","مِنْهَا","فَبَدَتْ","لَهُمَا","سَوْءَٰتُهُمَا","وَطَفِقَا","يَخْصِفَانِ","عَلَيْهِمَا","مِن","وَرَقِ","ٱلْجَنَّةِ","وَعَصَىٰٓ","ءَادَمُ","رَبَّهُۥ","فَغَوَىٰ"],"marked":[11],"facts":{"verb":"عَصَى"}},{"id":"asa-2-26-216-1","words":["verb:asa-2"],"options":[{"bs":"nisu te poslušali","en":"they disobeyed you"},{"bs":"i nije poslušao","en":"and he/it disobeyed"},{"bs":"i niste poslušali","en":"and you (all) disobeyed"},{"bs":"oglušim se","en":"I disobey"}],"ref":"26:216","answerWord":"عَصَوْكَ","answerSound":"audio/a987fd9a1f5fdec804c0.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"And if they (thy kinsfolk) disobey thee, say: Lo! I am innocent of what they do.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"ne poslušati, biti neposlušan","en":"to disobey"},"passage":["فَإِنْ","عَصَوْكَ","فَقُلْ","إِنِّى","بَرِىٓءٌ","مِّمَّا","تَعْمَلُونَ"],"marked":[1],"facts":{"verb":"عَصَى"}},{"id":"asa-2-66-6-15","words":["verb:asa-2"],"options":[{"bs":"ne slušaju","en":"they disobey"},{"bs":"nisi poslušao","en":"you disobeyed"},{"bs":"i nisu poslušali","en":"and they disobeyed"},{"bs":"oglušim se","en":"I disobey"}],"ref":"66:6","answerWord":"يَعْصُونَ","answerSound":"audio/ae001f4daba9e2e8c7f8.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"O ye who believe! Ward off from yourselves and your families a Fire whereof the fuel is men and stones, over which are set angels strong, severe, who resist not Allah in that which He commandeth them, but do that which they are commanded.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"ne poslušati, biti neposlušan","en":"to disobey"},"passage":["يَٰٓأَيُّهَا","ٱلَّذِينَ","ءَامَنُوا۟","قُوٓا۟","أَنفُسَكُمْ","وَأَهْلِيكُمْ","نَارًا","وَقُودُهَا","ٱلنَّاسُ","وَٱلْحِجَارَةُ","عَلَيْهَا","مَلَٰٓئِكَةٌ","غِلَاظٌ","شِدَادٌ","لَّا","يَعْصُونَ","ٱللَّهَ","مَآ","أَمَرَهُمْ","وَيَفْعَلُونَ","مَا","يُؤْمَرُونَ"],"marked":[15],"facts":{"verb":"عَصَى"}},{"id":"asa-2-69-10-0","words":["verb:asa-2"],"options":[{"bs":"pa nisu poslušali","en":"so they disobeyed"},{"bs":"nisam poslušao","en":"I disobeyed"},{"bs":"pa nije poslušao","en":"so he/it disobeyed"},{"bs":"ne slušaju te","en":"they disobey you"}],"ref":"69:10","answerWord":"فَعَصَوْا۟","answerSound":"audio/3c659f0c5c3f9e02219f.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"And they disobeyed the messenger of their Lord, therefor did He grip them with a tightening grip.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"ne poslušati, biti neposlušan","en":"to disobey"},"passage":["فَعَصَوْا۟","رَسُولَ","رَبِّهِمْ","فَأَخَذَهُمْ","أَخْذَةً","رَّابِيَةً"],"marked":[0],"facts":{"verb":"عَصَى"}},{"id":"asa-2-71-21-4","words":["verb:asa-2"],"options":[{"bs":"nisu me poslušali","en":"they disobeyed me"},{"bs":"zar si onda ne poslušao","en":"so did you disobey"},{"bs":"i niste poslušali","en":"and you (all) disobeyed"},{"bs":"i nismo poslušali","en":"and we disobeyed"}],"ref":"71:21","answerWord":"عَصَوْنِى","answerSound":"audio/6ae73131c04975da229e.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Noah said: My Lord! Lo! they have disobeyed me and followed one whose wealth and children increase him in naught save ruin;","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"ne poslušati, biti neposlušan","en":"to disobey"},"passage":["قَالَ","نُوحٌ","رَّبِّ","إِنَّهُمْ","عَصَوْنِى","وَٱتَّبَعُوا۟","مَن","لَّمْ","يَزِدْهُ","مَالُهُۥ","وَوَلَدُهُۥٓ","إِلَّا","خَسَارًا"],"marked":[4],"facts":{"verb":"عَصَى"}},{"id":"asa-2-73-16-0","words":["verb:asa-2"],"options":[{"bs":"pa nije poslušao","en":"so he/it disobeyed"},{"bs":"zar si onda ne poslušao","en":"so did you disobey"},{"bs":"nisam poslušao","en":"I disobeyed"},{"bs":"pa nisu poslušali","en":"so they disobeyed"}],"ref":"73:16","answerWord":"فَعَصَىٰ","answerSound":"audio/f6fd188e38927b67aece.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"But Pharaoh rebelled against the messenger, whereupon We seized him with no gentle grip.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"ne poslušati, biti neposlušan","en":"to disobey"},"passage":["فَعَصَىٰ","فِرْعَوْنُ","ٱلرَّسُولَ","فَأَخَذْنَٰهُ","أَخْذًا","وَبِيلًا"],"marked":[0],"facts":{"verb":"عَصَى"}},{"id":"asa-2-79-21-1","words":["verb:asa-2"],"options":[{"bs":"i nije poslušao","en":"and he/it disobeyed"},{"bs":"nisu me poslušali","en":"they disobeyed me"},{"bs":"pa nisu poslušali","en":"so they disobeyed"},{"bs":"zar si onda ne poslušao","en":"so did you disobey"}],"ref":"79:21","answerWord":"وَعَصَىٰ","answerSound":"audio/59081ac75ef3846b0962.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"But he denied and disobeyed,","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"ne poslušati, biti neposlušan","en":"to disobey"},"passage":["فَكَذَّبَ","وَعَصَىٰ"],"marked":[1],"facts":{"verb":"عَصَى"}},{"id":"rama-24-4-1","words":["verb:rama"],"options":[{"bs":"potvaraju","en":"they accuse"},{"bs":"bacio je","en":"he/it threw"},{"bs":"potvara","en":"he/it accuses"},{"bs":"baca","en":"it throws"}],"ref":"24:4","answerWord":"يَرْمُونَ","answerSound":"audio/1344e313ee25a939ee94.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"And those who accuse honourable women but bring not four witnesses, scourge them (with) eighty stripes and never (afterward) accept their testimony - They indeed are evil-doers -","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"baciti","en":"to throw"},"passage":["وَٱلَّذِينَ","يَرْمُونَ","ٱلْمُحْصَنَٰتِ","ثُمَّ","لَمْ","يَأْتُوا۟","بِأَرْبَعَةِ","شُهَدَآءَ","فَٱجْلِدُوهُمْ","ثَمَٰنِينَ","جَلْدَةً","وَلَا","تَقْبَلُوا۟","لَهُمْ","شَهَٰدَةً","أَبَدًا","وَأُو۟لَٰٓئِكَ","هُمُ","ٱلْفَٰسِقُونَ"],"marked":[1],"facts":{"verb":"رَمَى"}},{"id":"rama-8-17-6","words":["verb:rama"],"options":[{"bs":"bacio si","en":"you threw"},{"bs":"potvaraju","en":"they accuse"},{"bs":"bacio je","en":"he/it threw"},{"bs":"potvara","en":"he/it accuses"}],"ref":"8:17","answerWord":"رَمَيْتَ","answerSound":"audio/73b4a8d7b7b6a2dc7f61.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Ye (Muslims) slew them not, but Allah slew them. And thou (Muhammad) threwest not when thou didst throw, but Allah threw, that He might test the believers by a fair test from Him. Lo! Allah is Hearer, Knower.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"baciti","en":"to throw"},"passage":["فَلَمْ","تَقْتُلُوهُمْ","وَلَٰكِنَّ","ٱللَّهَ","قَتَلَهُمْ","وَمَا","رَمَيْتَ","إِذْ","رَمَيْتَ","وَلَٰكِنَّ","ٱللَّهَ","رَمَىٰ","وَلِيُبْلِىَ","ٱلْمُؤْمِنِينَ","مِنْهُ","بَلَآءً","حَسَنًا","إِنَّ","ٱللَّهَ","سَمِيعٌ","عَلِيمٌ"],"marked":[6,8],"facts":{"verb":"رَمَى"}},{"id":"rama-4-112-6","words":["verb:rama"],"options":[{"bs":"potvara","en":"he/it accuses"},{"bs":"potvaraju","en":"they accuse"},{"bs":"bacio si","en":"you threw"},{"bs":"bacio je","en":"he/it threw"}],"ref":"4:112","answerWord":"يَرْمِ","answerSound":"audio/31f680a5ec5cf80010ed.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"And whoso committeth a delinquency or crime, then throweth (the blame) thereof upon the innocent, hath burdened himself with falsehood and a flagrant crime.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"baciti","en":"to throw"},"passage":["وَمَن","يَكْسِبْ","خَطِيٓـَٔةً","أَوْ","إِثْمًا","ثُمَّ","يَرْمِ","بِهِۦ","بَرِيٓـًٔا","فَقَدِ","ٱحْتَمَلَ","بُهْتَٰنًا","وَإِثْمًا","مُّبِينًا"],"marked":[6],"facts":{"verb":"رَمَى"}},{"id":"rama-8-17-11","words":["verb:rama"],"options":[{"bs":"bacio je","en":"he/it threw"},{"bs":"baca","en":"it throws"},{"bs":"bacio si","en":"you threw"},{"bs":"potvaraju","en":"they accuse"}],"ref":"8:17","answerWord":"رَمَىٰ","answerSound":"audio/3c6a36a844bb487398cd.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Ye (Muslims) slew them not, but Allah slew them. And thou (Muhammad) threwest not when thou didst throw, but Allah threw, that He might test the believers by a fair test from Him. Lo! Allah is Hearer, Knower.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"baciti","en":"to throw"},"passage":["فَلَمْ","تَقْتُلُوهُمْ","وَلَٰكِنَّ","ٱللَّهَ","قَتَلَهُمْ","وَمَا","رَمَيْتَ","إِذْ","رَمَيْتَ","وَلَٰكِنَّ","ٱللَّهَ","رَمَىٰ","وَلِيُبْلِىَ","ٱلْمُؤْمِنِينَ","مِنْهُ","بَلَآءً","حَسَنًا","إِنَّ","ٱللَّهَ","سَمِيعٌ","عَلِيمٌ"],"marked":[11],"facts":{"verb":"رَمَى"}},{"id":"hajara-2-19-46-10","words":["verb:hajara-2"],"options":[{"bs":"i napusti me!","en":"and leave me!"},{"bs":"govorili ste besmislice","en":"you talked nonsense"},{"bs":"i kloni ih se","en":"and keep away from them"},{"bs":"i ostavite ih!","en":"and (you all) forsake them!"}],"ref":"19:46","answerWord":"وَٱهْجُرْنِى","answerSound":"audio/0127a291f103796ffe73.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"He said: Rejectest thou my gods, O Abraham? If thou cease not, I shall surely stone thee. Depart from me a long while!","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"napustiti, kloniti se","en":"to leave, to abandon, to shun"},"passage":["قَالَ","أَرَاغِبٌ","أَنتَ","عَنْ","ءَالِهَتِى","يَٰٓإِبْرَٰهِيمُ","لَئِن","لَّمْ","تَنتَهِ","لَأَرْجُمَنَّكَ","وَٱهْجُرْنِى","مَلِيًّا"],"marked":[10],"facts":{"verb":"هَجَرَ"}},{"id":"hajara-2-23-67-3","words":["verb:hajara-2"],"options":[{"bs":"govorili ste besmislice","en":"you talked nonsense"},{"bs":"i napusti me!","en":"and leave me!"},{"bs":"i kloni ih se","en":"and keep away from them"},{"bs":"pa se kloni!","en":"so shun!"}],"ref":"23:67","answerWord":"تَهْجُرُونَ","answerSound":"audio/712e3debb4830b5c7e1e.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"In scorn thereof. Nightly did ye rave together.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"napustiti, kloniti se","en":"to leave, to abandon, to shun"},"passage":["مُسْتَكْبِرِينَ","بِهِۦ","سَٰمِرًا","تَهْجُرُونَ"],"marked":[3],"facts":{"verb":"هَجَرَ"}},{"id":"hajara-2-73-10-4","words":["verb:hajara-2"],"options":[{"bs":"i kloni ih se","en":"and keep away from them"},{"bs":"i napusti me!","en":"and leave me!"},{"bs":"pa se kloni!","en":"so shun!"},{"bs":"govorili ste besmislice","en":"you talked nonsense"}],"ref":"73:10","answerWord":"وَٱهْجُرْهُمْ","answerSound":"audio/1309cff14509ef08f9c3.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"And bear with patience what they utter, and part from them with a fair leave-taking.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"napustiti, kloniti se","en":"to leave, to abandon, to shun"},"passage":["وَٱصْبِرْ","عَلَىٰ","مَا","يَقُولُونَ","وَٱهْجُرْهُمْ","هَجْرًا","جَمِيلًا"],"marked":[4],"facts":{"verb":"هَجَرَ"}},{"id":"hajara-2-74-5-1","words":["verb:hajara-2"],"options":[{"bs":"pa se kloni!","en":"so shun!"},{"bs":"i ostavite ih!","en":"and (you all) forsake them!"},{"bs":"i kloni ih se","en":"and keep away from them"},{"bs":"govorili ste besmislice","en":"you talked nonsense"}],"ref":"74:5","answerWord":"فَٱهْجُرْ","answerSound":"audio/12824bb8281594238973.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Pollution shun!","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"napustiti, kloniti se","en":"to leave, to abandon, to shun"},"passage":["وَٱلرُّجْزَ","فَٱهْجُرْ"],"marked":[1],"facts":{"verb":"هَجَرَ"}}]